---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">What you get</span>
      <h2 id="features-title" class="h2">A console experience,<br /> <span class="gradient-text">from the PC you already own.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">
        VaporOS is an immutable, CachyOS-based appliance. It does one job: it keeps Steam ready to
        stream, and it stays out of your way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="bento">
      <li class="card glass spot wide reveal" style="--i:0">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="gamepad" /></span><h3>Stream to any screen</h3></div>
        <p>Play your Steam library on a TV, phone, tablet or laptop with Moonlight. Sunshine runs on the PC, already set up for you.</p>
        <div class="devices" aria-hidden="true">
          <span><Icon name="tv" />TV</span>
          <span><Icon name="phone" />Phone</span>
          <span><Icon name="laptop" />Laptop</span>
          <span><Icon name="monitor" />Desktop</span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="card glass spot wide reveal" style="--i:1">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="hdr" /></span><h3>The display follows your device</h3></div>
        <p>No dummy plug. A virtual display takes each Moonlight client's resolution, frame rate and HDR, so every screen gets its own picture.</p>
        <div class="modes" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="mode">2796x1290<b>@120</b></span>
          <span class="mode on">3840x2160<b>@60</b><i>HDR</i></span>
          <span class="mode">1920x1080<b>@60</b></span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="card glass spot reveal" style="--i:0">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="phone" /></span><h3>Run it from your phone</h3></div>
        <p>Install, pair, update and power off in your browser at <code>vapor.local</code>. The PC never shows a terminal.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card glass spot reveal" style="--i:1">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="rollback" /></span><h3>Updates that undo themselves</h3></div>
        <p>A new version goes to the slot you aren't running. If it doesn't start cleanly, VaporOS goes back to the previous one by itself.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card glass spot reveal" style="--i:2">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="shield" /></span><h3>Signed, checked, read-only</h3></div>
        <p>Every update carries an ed25519 signature, checked before anything is written, and each file is verified before the new version can start. The system itself is read-only.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card glass spot reveal" style="--i:3">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="zap" /></span><h3>Tuned by CachyOS</h3></div>
        <p>The CachyOS kernel and x86-64-v3 packages, with its zram, scheduler and I/O tuning built in.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card glass spot wide reveal" style="--i:0">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="drive" /></span><h3>Bring your Steam libraries</h3></div>
        <p>Already have games on another drive? Pick it during setup, or later under Storage, and keep playing. Nothing on it is changed.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card glass spot wide reveal" style="--i:1">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile"><Icon name="moon" /></span><h3>Off when idle, awake on demand</h3></div>
        <p>VaporOS powers off when nobody plays, but never while streaming, downloading or updating. Moonlight wakes it over Wake-on-LAN.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-deep), var(--bg) 40%, var(--bg-deep)); }
  .bento {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .bento { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .wide { grid-column: span 2; }
  }
  .card {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color .3s, transform .4s var(--ease-out), box-shadow .4s;
  }
  .card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute; inset: auto -30% -60% auto;
    width: 70%; aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgb(120 190 255 / .1), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity .4s;
    opacity: .6;
  }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-line); transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow), 0 30px 60px -40px rgb(76 150 232 / .6); }
  .card:hover::after { opacity: 1; }
  .card-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .card p { color: var(--text-2); font-size: .98rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .card { padding: 28px; }
    .wide .card-top { gap: 16px; }
    .wide h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  }

  .devices, .modes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 6px; }
  .devices span {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 11px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / .035); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--text-2); font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 550;
  }
  .devices :global(.ico) { width: 17px; height: 17px; color: var(--brand); }
  .mode {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px;
    padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 11px;
    font: 500 .82rem/1.2 var(--mono);
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / .035); border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .mode b { color: var(--text-3); font-weight: 500; }
  .mode i {
    font-style: normal; margin-left: 8px; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 5px;
    font: 700 .68rem/1.4 var(--font); letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: var(--brand-ink);
    background: var(--vapor);
  }
  .mode.on { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--accent-line); background: var(--accent-soft); box-shadow: 0 0 24px -6px rgb(120 190 255 / .45); }
  .mode.on b { color: var(--brand); }
</style>
